# macOS and per-developer Xcode state
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# Xcode-generated SwiftPM workspace state. Regenerated on open; tracking it
# only produces churn between machines.
/.swiftpm/

# Machine-local scientific corpora and migration snapshots.
#
# One deliberate exception: the py4DSTEM **Python source** under
# References/py4DSTEM-dev/ stays tracked, because the inline `DEVIATION` notes
# throughout Core/ cite it by file and line, and those citations are worthless
# if the reader cannot see the exact version they refer to. Its LICENSE.txt and
# CITATION.cff are kept with it, since vendoring GPL source without its licence
# would be wrong.
#
# Its documentation, images, CI configuration and devcontainer are NOT tracked
# (removed 2026-08-06): ~6.6 MB of material that serves no purpose here, and it
# dominated both the repository's language statistics and anything built from
# the working tree.
/References

# Local build products
/build/
/DerivedData/

# tools/ui-qc-playthrough dev-scoping handoff (see run.sh)
/.ui-qc-filter
/.ui-qc-no-screenshots
